+# Printer Controls Section — Design Specification
+
+**Issue:** [#283](https://github.com/OlyForge3D/PrintFarmer/issues/283)  
+**Author:** Newt (Industrial UI Designer)  
+**Date:** 2026-05-28  
+**Status:** Ready for Implementation
+
+## Overview
+
+This document specifies the UI design for the **Printer Controls** section in `PrinterDetailView.swift`. The section contains three subgroups: **Preheat**, **Home**, and **Jog** — providing operators with quick access to common maintenance tasks.
+
+### Design Principles
+
+- **Industrial precision:** Clear, data-forward controls with unambiguous labels
+- **Dark-first:** Designed for `pfBackground` (#0b1020) with appropriate contrast
+- **Accessible:** WCAG 2.2 AA compliant, color-blind friendly disabled states
+- **HIG compliant:** All touch targets ≥44pt per Apple Human Interface Guidelines
+
+---
+
+## Section Placement
+
+### Phone (Compact Width)
+
+The Controls section appears in `printerContent(_:)` **after** `actionSection` and **before** the view's bottom padding. It is rendered only when `printer.isOnline == true`.
+
+```
+┌────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│ Header Section                         │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Temperatures Section                   │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Current Job (if printing/paused)       │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Camera Section                         │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Failure Detection (if active)          │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Filament Section                       │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Auto-Dispatch Section                  │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Predictive Insights Link               │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Action Section (pause/resume/stop)     │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ ▶ CONTROLS SECTION (new)               │  ← NEW
+│   ├ Preheat Subgroup                   │
+│   ├ Home Subgroup                      │
+│   └ Jog Subgroup                       │
+└────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+### iPad (Regular Width — 2-Column)
+
+In `iPadPrinterContent(_:)`, allocate Controls to the **left column** below Action Section:
+
+| Left Column | Right Column |
+|-------------|--------------|
+| Header | Camera |
+| Temperatures | Current Job |
+| Filament | Failure Detection |
+| Auto-Dispatch | |
+| Predictive Insights | |
+| Action Section | |
+| **Controls Section** | |
