+## Preheat Subgroup
+
+### Layout — List Style (Recommended)
+
+A vertical list provides clear temperature readouts and sufficient touch targets.
+
+```
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Preheat                                                │
+├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
+│  │ [🔥] PLA                               200° / 60° │  │
+│  ├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │
+│  │ [🔥] PETG                             240° / 80°  │  │
+│  ├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │
+│  │ [🔥] ABS                              240° / 100° │  │
+│  ├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │
+│  │ [❄️] Cool Down                          0° / 0°   │  │
+│  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
+└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+### Component Anatomy
+
+```swift
+// PreheatRow — individual button row
+HStack {
+    Image(systemName: isCoolDown ? "snowflake" : "flame.fill")
+        .font(.body)
+        .foregroundStyle(isCoolDown ? Color.pfSecondaryAccent : Color.pfWarning)
+        .frame(width: 24)
+    
+    Text(materialName)                    // "PLA", "PETG", "ABS", "Cool Down"
+        .font(.subheadline.weight(.medium))
+    
+    Spacer()
+    
+    Text("\(hotendTemp)° / \(bedTemp)°")  // "200° / 60°"
+        .font(.subheadline.monospacedDigit())
+        .foregroundStyle(Color.pfTextSecondary)
+}
+.frame(minHeight: 44)                     // HIG touch target
+.contentShape(Rectangle())               // Full row tappable
+```
+
+### Presets (v1 Locked)
+
+| Material | Hotend | Bed | Icon |
+|----------|--------|-----|------|
+| PLA | 200°C | 60°C | `flame.fill` (pfWarning) |
+| PETG | 240°C | 80°C | `flame.fill` (pfWarning) |
+| ABS | 240°C | 100°C | `flame.fill` (pfWarning) |
+| Cool Down | 0°C | 0°C | `snowflake` (pfSecondaryAccent) |
+
+### Card Styling
+
+```swift
+VStack(spacing: 0) {
+    ForEach(presets) { preset in
+        PreheatRow(preset: preset, isDisabled: isDisabled, isPending: pendingPreset == preset)
+            .onTapGesture { /* call setTemps */ }
+        
+        if preset != presets.last {
+            Divider()
+                .padding(.leading, 36)  // Align with text, not icon
+        }
+    }
+}
+.padding(.vertical, 4)
+.background(Color.pfCard, in: RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))
+.overlay(
+    RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12)
+        .strokeBorder(Color.pfBorder, lineWidth: 1)
+)
+```
