+## Home Subgroup
+
+### Layout — Horizontal Button Row
+
+Three equally-sized buttons in a single row.
+
+```
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Home                                                   │
+├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│  ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐     │
+│  │   Home All   │ │   Home XY    │ │   Home Z     │     │
+│  │     [🏠]     │ │    [↔️]      │ │    [↕️]      │     │
+│  └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘     │
+└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+### Component Anatomy
+
+```swift
+HStack(spacing: 10) {
+    HomeButton(label: "Home All", icon: "house.fill", action: homeAll)
+    HomeButton(label: "Home XY", icon: "arrow.left.and.right", action: homeXY)
+    HomeButton(label: "Home Z", icon: "arrow.up.and.down", action: homeZ)
+}
+```
+
+### HomeButton View
+
+```swift
+Button(action: action) {
+    VStack(spacing: 6) {
+        Image(systemName: icon)
+            .font(.title3)
+        Text(label)
+            .font(.caption.weight(.medium))
+    }
